  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6708066",
      "title": "Creating the Form For Editing Recipes",
      "lectureOrder": 552,
      "videoOrder": 507,
      "sourceHash": "25f18d7e655e12f39512496b7194c14b7f2f212852db94d139fa040edec63854",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.34,
          "end": 3.33,
          "en": "Instructor: So in the last section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.33,
          "end": 6.36,
          "en": "we created the HTML code for our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.36,
          "end": 8.73,
          "en": "Now let's initialize our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.73,
          "end": 12.21,
          "en": "and we will use the reactive approach, as I already said.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 14.91,
          "en": "Now, for this approach, it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.91,
          "end": 17.31,
          "en": "if we are in editMode or newMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.31,
          "end": 19.8,
          "en": "and we do get this information here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.8,
          "end": 21.69,
          "en": "Why is that important?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.69,
          "end": 23.94,
          "en": "Well, of course, because depending on this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.94,
          "end": 28.68,
          "en": "we need to pre-populate the fields or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.68,
          "end": 31.47,
          "en": "So, I will create a new private method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.47,
          "end": 36,
          "en": "in the RecipeEditComponent, which I'll name initForm,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36,
          "end": 40.08,
          "en": "because it is responsible for initializing our form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 43.14,
          "en": "The form itself shall be a property here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.14,
          "end": 45.03,
          "en": "so I will name it recipeForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.03,
          "end": 46.8,
          "en": "and it will be of type FormGroup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 51.54,
          "en": "as you learned, to be imported from @angular/forms.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.54,
          "end": 55.983,
          "en": "Now we can build this recipe form here in initForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 60.57,
          "en": "Basically, I will reach out to it and assign a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.57,
          "end": 63.09,
          "en": "and this value will be a new form group",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.09,
          "end": 67.11,
          "en": "to give us the outer shell of our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.11,
          "end": 68.793,
          "en": "so to say, the frame.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 69.78,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "FormGroup takes a JavaScript object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 73.71000000000001,
          "en": "where we have key value pairs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.71000000000001,
          "end": 76.47,
          "en": "for the controls we want to register.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.47,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "So, the first control I do want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 83.6,
          "en": "to register here is the name, the name of the recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84,
          "end": 86.16499999999999,
          "en": "This will be a new FormControl,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 86.16499999999999,
          "end": 89.977,
          "en": "so we should import FormControl from @angular/forms too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.69,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "And here, now, as I said,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 96.9,
          "en": "it's important to decide whether we are in editMode or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.9,
          "end": 99.27000000000001,
          "en": "because that will determine whether we want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 99.27000000000001,
          "end": 102.50999999999999,
          "en": "to assign a initial value or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.50999999999999,
          "end": 106.53,
          "en": "Well, we could simply create a variable at the top here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 106.53,
          "end": 108.53999999999999,
          "en": "which holds our recipe name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 108.53999999999999,
          "end": 112.74000000000001,
          "en": "and let's set it to an empty string by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.74000000000001,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "Then, let's add some logic which decides what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 119.94,
          "en": "the value should be if we are in editMode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.94,
          "end": 123.15,
          "en": "So let's check if this.editMode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "If that's the case,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "then recipeName should probably be something else,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 133.29,
          "en": "and it should probably be the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 138,
          "en": "of the recipe we can load with the id we got here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 141.27,
          "en": "we do have the id stored up there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.27,
          "end": 146.27,
          "en": "so, we can simply inject our recipeService.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.82,
          "end": 149.19,
          "en": "Let's do this here, recipeService,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.19,
          "end": 152.913,
          "en": "make sure to add the import at the top here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.75,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "And now we can fetch our recipe here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 159.603,
          "en": "the recipe we're currently editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.44,
          "end": 163.8,
          "en": "So, I will fetch it right at the beginning, the recipe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 163.8,
          "end": 166.23,
          "en": "reaching out to the recipeService,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 166.23,
          "end": 167.86,
          "en": "and then with getRecipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 173.16,
          "en": "and passing the id of the recipe we know we are editing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 173.16,
          "end": 174.69,
          "en": "I can get it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.69,
          "end": 176.46,
          "en": "Actually, I shouldn't do it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.46,
          "end": 179.28,
          "en": "because I would try to get one if we don't have an id",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.28,
          "end": 181.35,
          "en": "because we are not an editMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 183.003,
          "en": "I should do it in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 186.39,
          "en": "So now we got a recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.39,
          "end": 189.09,
          "en": "Now we can simply access the name of the recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 192.42,
          "en": "and assign this to our variable here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.42,
          "end": 195.87,
          "en": "Now, the same will be true for the image URL,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.87,
          "end": 198.69,
          "en": "the recipeImagePath.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.69,
          "end": 200.88,
          "en": "It's an empty string by default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.88,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "and the same is probably true for the description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 207.03,
          "en": "so recipeDescription is also an empty string by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 210.63,
          "en": "and the ingredients, I'll come back to these.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.63,
          "end": 214.38,
          "en": "So for now, let's override all these variables",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.38,
          "end": 216.382,
          "en": "if we are in editMode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.382,
          "end": 221.04,
          "en": "So, recipeImagePath will be set to recipe.imagePath,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.04,
          "end": 223.2,
          "en": "and recipeDescription will be set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.2,
          "end": 226.65,
          "en": "to recipe.description here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.65,
          "end": 231.65,
          "en": "and with that, we can simply assign recipeName here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 231.69,
          "end": 233.46,
          "en": "for the name as a default value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.46,
          "end": 235.59,
          "en": "because it will either be an empty string,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.59,
          "end": 239.28,
          "en": "that's the default, or if we happen to be an editMode,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 239.28,
          "end": 240.84,
          "en": "it will have the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 240.84,
          "end": 243.813,
          "en": "of the recipe we are editing as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.98,
          "end": 247.26,
          "en": "So with that, we got the name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 247.26,
          "end": 250.26,
          "en": "Now, let's also assign the imagePath.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.26,
          "end": 253.05,
          "en": "Here, I'll also add a new FormControl",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.05,
          "end": 255.48,
          "en": "and set this to recipeImagePath.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 255.48,
          "end": 259.14,
          "en": "As a side note, we'll take care about validation later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.14,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "and let's assign the description here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 264.33,
          "en": "a new FormControl again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.33,
          "end": 267.153,
          "en": "and we should assign the recipeDescription.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.08,
          "end": 271.98,
          "en": "Now, again, I'll take care about the ingredients later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 271.98,
          "end": 275.01,
          "en": "That is our base form created.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 275.01,
          "end": 279.003,
          "en": "Now, when should we call initForm, this method here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 280.47,
          "end": 284.49,
          "en": "We should call it whenever our route parents change,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 284.49,
          "end": 287.90999999999997,
          "en": "because that indicates that we reloaded the page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 287.90999999999997,
          "end": 290.913,
          "en": "so that is where we should call this initForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 292.26,
          "end": 294.3,
          "en": "Now with that, we are creating the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 294.3,
          "end": 296.52,
          "en": "and it probably will work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.52,
          "end": 300.06,
          "en": "however, now we need to synchronize our form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 300.06,
          "end": 302.04,
          "en": "to our HTML code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 302.04,
          "end": 304.203,
          "en": "Will do this in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
